WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.267 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Let's get to the news.

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.069 align:start size:94% position:6%
Christmas is less
than one week away.

00:00:03.069 --> 00:00:07.307
And then it's right back to
the attic for Michael Bublé.

00:00:07.307 --> 00:00:11.811 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:11.811 --> 00:00:13.613 align:start size:94% position:6%
According to CNN,
President Trump

00:00:13.613 --> 00:00:17.317
is leading the push
for a full and rapid withdrawal

00:00:17.317 --> 00:00:18.885 line:92%
of U.S. troops from Syria.

00:00:18.885 --> 00:00:20.186 line:92%
Apparently he just found out

00:00:20.186 --> 00:00:24.057 align:start size:94% position:6%
that Syria does not share
a border with Mexico.

00:00:24.057 --> 00:00:26.459 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:26.459 --> 00:00:29.529
CNN has obtained new documents
showing that President Trump

00:00:29.529 --> 00:00:33.033
signed a letter of intent to
move forward with negotiations

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
to build a Trump Tower
in Russia,

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:36.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
despite his attorney
Rudy Giuliani

00:00:36.703 --> 00:00:39.039 align:start size:94% position:6%
claiming that the document
was never signed.

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:41.474 align:start size:94% position:6%
Said Giuliani,
"That's not Trump's signature.

00:00:41.474 --> 00:00:44.444 size:88% position:44%
The document was clearly
signed by someone named

00:00:44.444 --> 00:00:46.446 line:92%
Aye yai yai aye yai yai yai!"

00:00:46.446 --> 00:00:51.151 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:51.151 --> 00:00:58.058 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:03.329 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.329 --> 00:01:05.331 size:81% position:41%
Senate majority leader
Mitch McConnell today

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:08.735
introduced a bill to fund the
government through February 8th.

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
Apparently there was
a lot of concern

00:01:10.904 --> 00:01:11.838 line:92%
about government employees

00:01:11.838 --> 00:01:13.706 size:78% position:39%
being left in a lurch
over the holidays.

00:01:13.706 --> 00:01:16.409 align:start size:94% position:6%
And what happened then?
Well, in Whoville, they say,

00:01:16.409 --> 00:01:20.180 size:78% position:39%
McConnell's neck grew
three sizes that day.

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.182 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Slide whistle ]

00:01:22.182 --> 00:01:28.822 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:28.822 --> 00:01:30.356 line:92%
Google has unveiled its list

00:01:30.356 --> 00:01:33.093
of the most searched celebrities
of 2018,

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:34.761 align:start size:94% position:6%
with Demi Lovato
topping the list,

00:01:34.761 --> 00:01:38.631
narrowly beating out the second
most searched-for celebrity,

00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:40.700 line:92%
someone to host the Oscars.

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:43.570 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:43.570 --> 00:01:44.204 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's right.

00:01:44.204 --> 00:01:45.472 line:92%
Google has unveiled its list

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:47.874 align:start size:94% position:6%
of the most searched-for
celebrities in 2018.

00:01:47.874 --> 00:01:52.412
And for the 81st year in a row,
it's Amelia Earhart.

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:57.016 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:57.016 --> 00:02:00.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah. Yeah, that's about
what I expected.

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:02.355 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:04.591 align:start size:94% position:6%
The New York state
attorney general's office

00:02:04.591 --> 00:02:07.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
has issued a report claiming
that over one quarter

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.996
of all seafood in grocery stores
is mislabeled.

00:02:09.996 --> 00:02:12.999 align:start size:94% position:6%
Don't believe me?
Check out this sushi.

00:02:12.999 --> 00:02:15.969 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:19.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
Police in Iowa were called on
a gym teacher this week

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:20.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
after she showed up
to work so drunk

00:02:20.707 --> 00:02:23.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
that she had red, watery eyes
and smelled of alcohol.

00:02:23.443 --> 00:02:28.515
Sounds like alcoholism was
the one ball she couldn't dodge.

00:02:28.515 --> 00:02:34.187 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience ohs ]

00:02:34.187 --> 00:02:36.389 line:92%
You guys, it's Christmas.

00:02:36.389 --> 00:02:39.959 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:43.329 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, I'm worried about
these next few.

00:02:43.329 --> 00:02:46.666 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.666 --> 00:02:49.569 size:88% position:44% line:92%
I'm excited and worried.

00:02:49.569 --> 00:02:52.539 align:start size:94% position:6%
A restaurant in Japan has
started selling a new line of

00:02:52.539 --> 00:02:55.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
girls' hair-flavored
fried chicken.

00:02:55.775 --> 00:02:57.544 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience ohs ]

00:02:57.544 --> 00:02:59.312 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And now, we wait.

00:02:59.312 --> 00:03:08.421 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:08.421 --> 00:03:11.257
"We see you ordered the chicken.
Take a seat."

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:13.026 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:13.026 --> 00:03:13.593 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That's right.

00:03:13.593 --> 00:03:15.528 align:start size:94% position:6%
A restaurant in Japan has
started a new line of

00:03:15.528 --> 00:03:17.463 align:start size:94% position:6%
girls' hair-flavored
fried chicken.

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:18.031 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
That story again.

00:03:18.031 --> 00:03:21.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
A restaurant in Japan
stopped using hair nets.

00:03:21.734 --> 00:03:23.770 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:23.770 --> 00:03:25.238 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Okay.

00:03:25.238 --> 00:03:26.973 line:92%
Can't figure you guys out.

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:28.508 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.508 --> 00:03:31.277 align:start size:94% position:6%
Finally, Scottish Parliament
yesterday

00:03:31.277 --> 00:03:32.845 line:92%
officially changed the name of

00:03:32.845 --> 00:03:35.215 align:start size:94% position:6%
gingerbread men
to gingerbread people.

00:03:35.215 --> 00:03:39.619 align:start size:94% position:6%
And if you like that,
you'll love person fingers.

